          "name": "Enviance.Rest Services.Ver2.Async.Impl.Command Service.Get Command",
          "request": {
            "name": "Enviance.Rest Services.Ver2.Async.Impl.Command Service.Get Command",
            "description": {
              "content": "\n\nReturns information about a previously submitted command (any API which is asynchronous).\r\n\r\n**Security:** All users.\r\n\r\n**SDK API (create):**  `envianceSdk.commands.getCommand (commandId, onsuccess, onerror)`\r\n\r\n```\r\nGET /ver2/CommandService.svc/commands/08fc5438-a0d8-4bf9-9141-12dd98e7ce80/ HTTP/1.1\r\n\r\n//RESPONSE\r\n{\r\n  \"id\": \"08fc5438-a0d8-4bf9-9141-12dd98e7ce80\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Data batch processed.\",\r\n  \"issued\": \"2012-12-01T08:00:00\",\r\n  \"startedProcessing\": \"2012-12-01T08:01:00\",\r\n  \"finishedProcessing\": \"2012-12-01T08:02:00\",\r\n  \"status\": \"Succeeded\",\r\n  \"objects\": [\"/Facility A/Unit X/Parameter Z\"],\r\n  \"user\": \"JSmith\",\r\n  \"errorInfo\": {\r\n    \"error\": \"Requirement with Tag 'GZB_AVG_SORTED' could not be found in the system.\",\r\n    \"details\": [\r\n      { \"key\": \"Tag\", \"value\": \"GZB_AVG_SORTED\" },\r\n      { \"key\": \"Complete Date\", \"value\": \"2012-02-08T09:50:00\" },\r\n      { \"key\": \"Value\", \"value\": \"18.00803565979\" }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\n\n\nenvianceSdk.commands.getCommand\r\n```\r\n[\r\n  \"eccd2310-9b5f-440b-bf0d-91f9803d036b\",\r\n  \"onsuccess\",\r\n  \"onerror\"\r\n]\r\n```\r\n\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
